                        "recommendations": {
                          "received": [
                            {
                              "text": "Ryan is a true leader.  He inspires those who work with him and is astute, charismatic, and focused; for these reasons he is extremely effective at rallying colleagues around common goals and getting things done.  He possesses the rare capacity to integrate people skills and sense of humor with strategy and execution.  Ryan is brilliantly creative is responsible for initiating and executing the most successful, groundbreaking initiatives at Glam.  I consider it a privilege to work for Ryan.",
                              "caption": "March 18, 2009, Christina reported directly to Ryan",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Christina Lewis",
                                "headline": "Software Engineer",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAAAZalAB0KwE7W6XCLIVJZbcEPDa0Jxye_0",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/christinacece",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E03AQEdS69KBGFfpg/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1522412914598?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=o6ylzmJSekf12qp2OPHiCEmjQRLIFVGlF0RgJguqCQY"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "Ryan is a superb manager. Empowering, focused, detail-oriented, and most of all, encouraging. Ryan is also one of the most innovative thinkers I've met--which creates an exciting and inventive atmosphere in which to work. Furthermore, he is eager to hear from others--and always appreciates and promotes solid ideas.",
                              "caption": "March 18, 2009, Tracey reported directly to Ryan",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Tracey Harrington McCoy",
                                "headline": "Editor/Content Executive: AOL/Yahoo, People Mag, Newsweek, Parents Mag, Forbes, HelloGiggles, Aol/HuffPo | Founder & CEO, Written By Media",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAABc4usB7iPAwkuZgASMGW3ntSf3bSZJ6nA",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/traceyharringtonmccoy",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E03AQHdlP0XJDFcZg/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1626701875219?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=f0HwWjCXoN7ihUmM0ABZFu5a715I_prvaNrdDY28His"
                              }
                            }
                          ],
                          "given": [
                            {
                              "text": "Brian embodies the kind of leader every organization hopes to cultivate. He leads first with compassion, listening deeply, seeking to understand before seeking to be understood. Brian is the steady hand who clarifies the goal, breaks complexity into workable steps, and guides everyone toward an outcome that feels both ambitious and achievable. In our10 years of working together, his secret is his consistency: he shows up prepared, follows through on commitments, and never asks more of others than he\u2019s willing to give himself.\n\nMore importantly, he's just an exceptional human being. He champions our culture not by reciting values, but by living them: demonstrating integrity in decision-making, inclusivity in team-building, and curiosity in problem-solving. \n\nBrian is proof that you can drive results without sacrificing humanity.",
                              "caption": "May 13, 2025, Ryan managed Brian directly",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Brian McDaniel",
                                "headline": "Senior Director of Global Customer Support | Innovative Leader in Training, Collaboration, AI, & Strategic Initiatives | Expert in Employee Engagement & Operational Excellence",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAAC7r9cBlRPUU73qw1QduZ_XJfUZJMp14nY",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/brianmcdaniellinkedin",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5603AQGVRQDimSxzrQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_200_200/profile-displayphoto-shrink_200_200/0/1587009406257?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=tsPzKIE975fUlYnnR8O_FHUa-GWE9FefKhbpwlOSo1I"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "I'm learning a ton from Peter's newsletter and podcast, even after spending two decades in product. He's sharing some valuable insights on building in this new AI era. Plus, he cracks me up!",
                              "caption": "January 14, 2025, Ryan worked with Peter but they were at different companies",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Peter Yang",
                                "headline": "Practical AI tutorials and interview for busy people | Join 150K+ at behindthecraft.com",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAAC42vQBjTGum5sSTbrccZR6VVeWNqN84po",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/petergyang",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5603AQGUWeN9KCQpnA/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B56Z3KObZLJ4AI-/0/1777214274824?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=mfv-yFLoL_h6Uyp2zXSOFvc0kyD1d6hsk_l5q_xIs2M"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "I have had the privilege of witnessing Peggy's remarkable contributions to sustainability and environmental stewardship at LinkedIn. As the architect of our company's sustainability program, Peggy has been an unstoppable force. Her vision to create a program from scratch has not only set a new standard for corporate responsibility but has also cemented LinkedIn's commitment to being carbon negative, water positive, and zero waste.\n\nPeggy's ability to drive cross-enterprise collaboration turned ambitious pledges into tangible progress. Her leadership has inspired thousands of LinkedIn employees globally, mobilizing them towards a unified goal of sustainability. Her strategic foresight was instrumental in empowering our customers and members; under her guidance, our Product and Engineering teams have developed innovative solutions that connect green job seekers with green employers.\n\nAs a leader, Peggy is the epitome of persistence, blending optimism with pragmatism to overcome any challenge. Her win-win approach to collaboration has yielded numerous successful partnerships, further amplifying our sustainability efforts. Peggy's positive energy is contagious, and her skills as a communicator are unparalleled, both of which have been key in educating and mobilizing our workforce for action.\n\nIt's rare to find someone with such a profound impact on people, programs, and the planet. I wholeheartedly endorse Peggy for any future endeavor she chooses to pursue\u2014she will be an invaluable asset to any organization lucky enough to have her.",
                              "caption": "January 4, 2024, Ryan was senior to Peggy but didn't manage Peggy directly",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Peggy Brannigan",
                                "headline": "Sustainability Leader - Impact Advisor - Board Member - Mentor",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAANpWRIB_PxjA3_C9sEC3c0K8KPWP5reJco",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/peggybrannigan",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5603AQGlU9F12Gpmuw/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/B56ZTOY_cNGUAg-/0/1738629445728?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=AT-CBBIL135D_05yg-l3-YmwMJ-jMxJgYHggX0uewQM"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "Paul is an exceptional operator. He blends best in class awareness with an ability to filter the signal from the noise and execute on what\u2019s truly important at a world class level. He\u2019s also just a fun person to be around and able to bring joy and levity where needed to complex situations.",
                              "caption": "November 17, 2023, Ryan was senior to Paul but didn't manage Paul directly",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Paul Rockwell",
                                "headline": "Operations at Suno | Global AI Leader | Scaling Platforms to 1B+ Users | Patent Holder: Two-Factor Auth | Marine | ex-Pinterest | ex-LinkedIn | ex-PayPal",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAABkPXUBqe9Ype9xJzMqchQ4c2QnnjRGyek",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/prockwell",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQGC75uyGuqAYA/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4EaAhsbHSHYAI-/0/1787271690937?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=OmLSu6K1Gf9tfbN01FkL_62XBYelPfSug6bPl3OdG6s"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "Ian is hands down one of the most amazing people to work with in consumer technology. From an extremely rare and sophisticated mastery of community and content products, to an obsessive ownership and devotion to a product, to an intense ability to prioritize towards execution \u2013 Ian has all the hard skills and attributes of a strong product leader. \r\n\r\nBut more importantly, Ian is just a great person to be around. He\u2019s very flexible and reasonable in his approach \u2013 always searching for the \u201cright way\u201d vs. \u201chis way\u201d. He\u2019s not afraid of taking aggressive, yet calculated risks to innovate. He takes the time to build strong, meaningful relationships with people he works with, which leads to an almost cult-like following of people wanting to be associated and work with him. \r\n\r\nIan is a great consumer technology success story, and I eagerly look forward to using any new products he comes up with in the future!",
                              "caption": "January 4, 2014, Ryan managed Ian directly",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Ian McCarthy",
                                "headline": "Product coauthor and entrepreneur",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAAAAB1cBcAPyoGvLRv4ru2gs9OLYueBqoO8",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/ianmccarthy",
                                "profilePictureUrl": null
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "Once in a while you encounter a 10X engineer.  Sanjay, however, laughs at the 10X engineers because he is the rare breed of 20X engineer.  He is amongst the top 1% in every category important to a successful software engineer: strategic, hard worker, executor, problem solver, knows when to say yes, knows when to say no, great attitude, and just always fun to be around.   Sanjay is a legend and it's always a privilege to work with him.",
                              "caption": "May 22, 2012, Ryan worked with Sanjay on the same team",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Sanjay Dubey",
                                "headline": "Vice President of Engineering at LinkedIn",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAAARUmsBHDXIq2tG-pDfXa8cPcbyuxDLEao",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/sanjaysdubey",
                                "profilePictureUrl": null
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "As an investor, board member, operator, or friend,  Andrew can consistently be counted on as someone who provides solid and well informed advice and guidance. His people skills, comprehension of market trends, and ability to connect people with opportunities make him a tremendous asset for any business or individual looking to be successful.",
                              "caption": "April 1, 2010, Ryan reported directly to Andrew",
                              "recommendee": {
                                "name": "Andrew Braccia",
                                "headline": "Partner at Accel ",
                                "entityId": "ACoAAAB35FMBFakOMSQkdhjzGrt6-WfKRe-COtE",
                                "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewbraccia",
                                "profilePictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5603AQGeq85eLx8PUw/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1516282959407?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=tKqW7rnp1sb5De6YMZzvXburxpTpvXYCiyQGaIJJJQg"
                              }
                            }
                          ],
                          "total": 9,
                          "totalGiven": 7,
                          "totalReceived": 2
                        },
